From xaga-miui-camera-compat
Subject: [PATCH] Assume that mod_device is global

The MIUI camera otherwise launches the missing HyperOS Security Center
permission activity and exits when its result is canceled.

---
 smali_classes4/fs/a.smali | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/smali_classes4/fs/a.smali b/smali_classes4/fs/a.smali
index pearl..global 100644
--- a/smali_classes4/fs/a.smali
+++ b/smali_classes4/fs/a.smali
@@ -35,7 +35,7 @@
     const-string v1, "_global"

     invoke-virtual {v0, v1}, Ljava/lang/String;->contains(Ljava/lang/CharSequence;)Z

-    move-result v0
+    const/4 v0, 0x1

     sput-boolean v0, Lfs/a;->a:Z
